" [1] My Issues │ [2] Team Issues │ [3] Analytics                                "
"┌My Issues─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│No open issues ┌ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────┐                │"
"│               │Issue list                                   │                │"
"│               │  n, j   Move down                           │                │"
"│               │         Move up                             │                │"
"│               │         Move to the top                     │                │"
"│               │  G, gb  Move to the bottom                  │                │"
"│               │  C-d    Move down half a page               │                │"
"│               │  C-u    Move up half a page                 │                │"
"│               │  h      Focus the pane on the left          │                │"
"│               │  l      Focus the pane on the right         │                │"
"│               │  Enter  Open the focused issue              │                │"
"│               │  Esc    Close the top overlay or step back  │                │"
"│               │                                             │                │"
"│               │Everywhere                                   │                │"
"│               │  1      Show My Issues                      │                │"
"│               │  2      Show Team Issues                    │                │"
"│               │  3      Show Analytics                      │                │"
"│               │  ?, F1  Show every key for this context     │                │"
"│               │  Q      Quit lrat                           │                │"
"│               └ Esc close ──────────────────────────────────┘                │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" Esc close                                                                      "
